@Poc.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5147

### Health check
GET {{Poc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List todos
GET {{Poc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

### Create a todo
POST {{Poc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try the API from the .http file"
}

### Get one todo
GET {{Poc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/todos/1
Accept: application/json

### Update a todo
PUT {{Poc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wire the React frontend to the .NET API",
  "isComplete": true
}

### Delete a todo
DELETE {{Poc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/todos/1
